# Court witness (2026-10-01 consolidation). Positive family fixture: a complete F5 control carrying all 13 required properties.
@prefix dfcm: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/dfcm#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
dfcm:F5Witness a dfcm:EnterpriseControl ; dfcm:order 1 ; dfcm:slug "f5-witness" ; rdfs:label "F5 witness" ; dfcm:domain "governance" ; dfcm:criticality "critical" ; dfcm:accountableRole "owner" ; dfcm:evidenceKind "receipt" ; dfcm:frameworkRef "NIST-CSF-2.0" ; dfcm:maxAgeHours 24 ; dfcm:automationLevel "full" ; dfcm:verifier "v" ; dfcm:falsifier "f" ; dfcm:required true .
